  "passage": {
    "text": "The warehouse is big and busy. There are long shelves with thousands of boxes. Every product has a label with a barcode. When an order arrives, a worker picks the products from the shelves. He scans each barcode with a small machine. Then he puts the products on a pallet and packs them. A forklift lifts the heavy pallets and moves them to the trucks. Safety is very important in a warehouse. Workers wear yellow jackets and they drive slowly. The manager says that a safe warehouse is a better warehouse.",
